  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;VILLE MURANEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ville Muranen is a 35-year-old Finnish volleyball sensation known for his pride in his partner Bernard John Croft and his upcoming volleyball season."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BERNARD JOHN CROFT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bernard John Croft is a 79-year-old renowned scientist and environmental biologist, known for his dedication to climate change and sustainability and his marriage to Ville Muranen."&lt;SEP&gt;"Bernard John Croft is a character known for his strong sense of duty and loyalty, and is married to Janet."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HELSINKI, FINLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Helsinki, Finland is the city where Ville and Bernard met and where the charity event took place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINNISH NATIONAL VOLLEYBALL TEAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Finnish National Volleyball Team is the team that Ville Muranen plays for."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIINA LAHTINEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tiina Lahtinen is a teammate of Ville Muranen on the Finnish National Volleyball Team and describes their relationship positively."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SAME-SEX MARRIAGES IN FINLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Same-Sex Marriages in Finland refers to the increasing trend of same-sex marriages in the country, with 2019 marking a record high of 542 unions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANET MADELEINE STREADER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Janet Madeleine Streader is a member of the British peerage and a member of the Streader family, known for her noble descent and public service."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROFT FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Croft Family is an esteemed lineage in the English gentry, known for their association with the landed aristocracy and their strong sense of duty and loyalty."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STREADER FAMILY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Streader Family is a family of noble descent, known for their history of valor, honor, and public service within the British peerage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rolling Hills is part of the quaint English countryside where Bernard John Croft and Janet Madeleine Streader met and lived."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STATELY MANOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Stately Manor is a part of the quaint English countryside where Bernard John Croft and Janet Madeleine Streader lived and met."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ENGLISH COUNTRYSIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"English Countryside is the setting where Bernard John Croft and Janet Madeleine Streader met and lived, known for its rolling hills and stately manors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITY EVENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charity Event is the event where Ville Muranen and Bernard John Croft met, leading to their romance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLIMATE CHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Climate Change is the area of expertise for Bernard John Croft, highlighting his dedication to sustainability and environmental biology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUSTAINABLE FORESTRY PRACTICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sustainable Forestry Practices is a new project Bernard John Croft is working on, indicating his ongoing commitment to environmental issues."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LGBTQ+ RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"LGBTQ+ Rights is mentioned in the context of the increasing trend of same-sex marriages in Finland, reflecting societal progress."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public Service is a value shared by both the Croft and Streader families, emphasizing their commitment to duty and community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUTY AND LOYALTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Duty and Loyalty are core values of the Croft Family, reflecting their strong sense of responsibility and commitment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VALOR AND HONOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Valor and Honor are core values of the Streader Family, reflecting their commitment to public service and integrity."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOVE AND LINEAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Love and Lineage are the themes that tie the stories of Ville Muranen and Bernard John Croft, and Bernard John Croft and Janet Madeleine Streader together."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Janet is a character whose sense of obligation to her family and title is unwavering, and she is married to Bernard John Croft."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THEIR FAMILIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Their Families refer to the interconnected lineage of Bernard and Janet through generations of marriage, alliances, and social bonds."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARRIAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Marriage is a significant event that brings Bernard and Janet together, symbolizing the union of two individuals from different yet complementary worlds."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0032</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
